      "value": "Google is you best friend \"contact vrchat\" gave me this:\n\nhttps://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/requests/new\n\nSelect: Support Request\n\nAnd that issue is Age verification.\n\nOther then that I must say this post is hilarious, it made my day.\n\nI think you are tho one of the few unlucky people seeing it works for most even me when I had my troll face on.\n\nThat's tech for you, awesome most of the times, but sometimes human interaction is needed.\n\nElse if you get the reply to try again if they just reset your tries I'll just throwing it out there to use another phone with better camera (just incase) and prey the gods you had enough sleep.",
